  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The number of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>, for which the system of equations :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>has no solution, is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QusHD",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
